{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>根據備案文件，MiniMax Group Inc.成立於2021年6月30日，註冊資本50000美元。公司此前已於2026年1月9日在香港聯交所上市，目前市值達2635億港元。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0530/9cb52ca2cd47856.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0530/711efe6e31d500f.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0530/9cb52ca2cd47856.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-30T07:22:24.040500+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}